  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\n<!-- Describe here the feature you are requesting. -->\r\nConsidering that people need unencrypted media files for a longer period of time (e.g. avatars, models custom uploaded by Thirdroom) and encrypted media files for a shorter period of time and with low ubiquity, is it desirable to manage the two types of files differently, e.g. with the option to clean up only encrypted files when cleaning up the files via the API?",
